WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.752
Journey twenty: manage profile and settings.

00:00:03.752 --> 00:00:08.757
A member edits their profile, changes their e-mail or password, chooses

00:00:08.757 --> 00:00:12.986
which e-mails arrive, and now sees where they are signed in.

00:00:13.862 --> 00:00:18.644
Your account holds the profile. The home church address is shown to no

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:23.358
one, and pronouns are used only in what the Jubilee team writes about

00:00:23.358 --> 00:00:24.110
the member.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.786
New in this run: Where you're signed in.

00:00:27.786 --> 00:00:32.687
This device comes first. Every other device shows its browser, the

00:00:32.687 --> 00:00:37.736
network it came from with the last part hidden, and when it was last

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:38.256
active.

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:42.193
Sign out ends that one device at once.

00:00:42.193 --> 00:00:46.110
The row goes, and this device stays signed in.

00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:52.250
In the admin application, the Jubilee team sees the owner's pronouns

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.488
beside their name, so the team words what it writes rightly.

00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:59.950
No business, member or public page is given them.

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:05.245
Behind the screen, the tests prove that each password and e-mail change

00:01:05.245 --> 00:01:09.362
is logged with the member, the address and the outcome, a refused one

00:01:09.362 --> 00:01:13.299
too; that another member's session is not found and the attempt is

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:17.117
logged; and that no other reader is given the home church or its

00:01:17.117 --> 00:01:17.594
address.

00:01:18.463 --> 00:01:23.420
Journey twenty is complete. The daily summary and promotional e-mail it

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.911
once waited for were built with journey seventeen.
